  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "1.吃的東西。[例]糧食、素食、節衣縮食。\n2.吃、吃飯。[例]發憤忘食、廢寢忘食、食髓知味。\n3.嚐到、承受。[例]自食惡果。\n4.星體因被遮蔽而缺損或消失。[例]日食、月食",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "4902",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "拿食物給人或牲畜吃。同「飼」。[例]推食食人",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5577",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "人名用字。如漢代有酈食其。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5908",
